We ended on Finding Nemo, the fireworks were such a fantastic way to end. 🧨 

BTS: the cast and crew gather for a closing party where they give out hilarious awards and everyone finds a way to say goodbye! They really do become such a family. Ugh. I’m GONNA MISS EVERYONE. Thank you errrrrrbody!!!

@mattymaleckimart was your understudy Jean Valjean this last Wednesday. 👏🏼. With a two hour lightning delay and hardly any sets the first half, he kill’d it! You have to check out his page. His voice should be studied!! How Matt?! How!!!

Fun story, he was one of the original Captain America’s in Rogers the Musical at Disneyland! 🇺🇸

